{"id":"f2b1eb1c4731bbe8","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-forcing-theorem.md","title":"Forcing Theorem","display":"thm-forcing-theorem — Forcing Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-forcing-theorem","aliases":["58-thm-forcing-theorem"],"display":"thm-forcing-theorem — Forcing Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-forcing-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-forcing-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-forcing-theorem — Forcing Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\)</span>（可数传递模型，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\le_P\\in M\">\\(P,\\le_P\\in M\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)\\)</span>（四元 generic 谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>（含集合论语言的签名）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-名称元组）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\\)</span>（迫使关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\\)</span>（名称解释，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{&lt;\\omega}\\right)\n\\to\\left(M[G]\\models\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\vec\\tau))\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in G\\;\\bigl(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{&lt;\\omega}\\right)\n\\to\\left(M[G]\\models\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\vec\\tau))\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in G\\;\\bigl(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>从扩张真值到某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in G\">\\(p\\in G\\)</span> 是 Truth Lemma；反向是迫使关系的健全性。</li>\n<li>完整 forcing theorem 还包括“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中可定义”的 Definability Lemma；本 Assertion 形式化其 truth-lemma 部分。</li>\n<li>参数必须由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-名称解释；若省略名称参数，公式会把对象语言与扩张中的语义混在一起。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})$（可数传递模型，见 [[58-df-ctm]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\le_P\\in M$ 且 $\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)$（见 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)$（四元 generic 谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)$（迫使关系，见 [[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}$（名称解释，见 [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\le_P\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\le_P)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\vec\\tau\\in(M^P)^{<\\omega}\\right)\n\\to\\left(M[G]\\models\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\vec\\tau))\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in G\\;\\bigl(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"p\\in G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{M,P}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"